                        "entry_id": "64d79428-e845-3121-81f1-1641d6e01dc6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone who deludes"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5c43b88-3cf9-4df9-8079-65533c6f90d6",
                                "sense_id": "510b3744-248b-3f5b-a34f-c34e4c06cde2",
                                "text": "But I am one who wish that Time, the great deluder, were not so over-masterful."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "41ce68e2-5f7c-4742-b128-7d8e799e1f1f",
                                "sense_id": "510b3744-248b-3f5b-a34f-c34e4c06cde2",
                                "text": "I saw her no longer as the deluder of Aunt Jane, but as herself the deluded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "78221485-b6da-4002-b173-ef2fb3d556a0",
                                "sense_id": "510b3744-248b-3f5b-a34f-c34e4c06cde2",
                                "text": "Or is it that from being a deluder of others he has become at last his own dupe as he is, if report belie him not, his own and his only enjoyer?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
